<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Dowse</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Ranger (guild level 5, up to 75%), Druid (guild level 15, up to 75%)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>dowse
</pre>
<p>Searches the land around you for water. When you succeed, a hidden spring 
bubbles up at your feet, and you can drink from it. Your skill and your 
brain decide it, and so does the land:
</p>
<ul><li>in the mountains and swamps the chances are excellent, but water found in a swamp may be foul;</li>
<li>in the hills they are very good;</li>
<li>in fields and forests they are good;</li>
<li>in the desert they are poor;</li>
<li>in towns and indoors there is no chance at all;</li>
<li>on or under water, you just fashion a cup from leaves and fill it;</li>
<li>on snow and ice, you melt a small pool in your hand, and the cold hurts a little.</li></ul>
<p>Each try takes 20 endurance.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Forage</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Drink</a>
</pre>




</div>